  "description": "Fifteen years ago, Knight Kirch rescued the princes held hostage by a neighboring country. Since then, he has secretly cherished the second prince, Sien, and vowed to protect him. For Sien alone, he has resolved to abandon both his honorable position as knight captain and his loyalty to the first prince, Sona...\n\n*\"Can you swear that you, as a knight, have no shame in following my brother?\"*\n\nHe has revealed his feelings, which should never be revealed, to \"the person who should be least exposed.\"\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
